  note    = {The only human PET occupancy study of any triptan, and the agonist failure mode in its own words. "After administration of 10 mg zolmitriptan, mean receptor occupancy was 4-5\%"; "This is the first demonstration of CNS 5-HT1B receptor occupancy of a triptan. The findings are consistent with the low receptor occupancy previously reported in PET studies with agonists at other G protein coupled receptors" (abstract, Europe PMC REST service, read 13 October 2026). 10 mg is twice the usual dose. Not open access; licence not verified. Sections 3 and 4.4(a) of docs/pet_occupancy_feasibility.md}
